(property "Intersheetrefs" "${INTERSHEET_REFS}" (at 530.86 350.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) hide))) (text "Power fault clears U407. Restoring rails does NOT re-arm: HIL_ARM must toggle low->high after RAILS_OK has settled. No automatic resume." (at 25.4 375.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a47d5989-3fa4-5068-b3ab-95280e8bea04")) (text "DAC_RESET_N is a 1.8V output, hardware-pulled LOW. HIL_FAULT_N is open-drain; require HOST-side pull-up. It reports POWER only." (at 25.4 383.54 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2e9f6380-e110-5686-af31-895f517a13d7")) (text "TP401 HIL_WDI is reserved, NOT an implemented watchdog. Complete heartbeat safety, physical AO disconnect and DUT gate inhibit remain OPEN." (at 25.4 391.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "9b4004ce-3d2b-50e8-8c7f-86159900ae50")) (text "Negative-rail sense folds PVSS with VREF; missing PVSS forces NEG_VALID low. Reference is independently monitored. Threshold/hysteresis need bench review." (at 25.4 398.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6c515433-a181-557d-b1df-4df1036fb003"))
